          visible even if the main photo is hidden by the business 
          account's privacy settings. An account can have only one 
          public photo. */
          isPublic             : Option[Boolean]
        } => Method[Boolean]
      
        /* Changes the username of a managed business account. Requires the 
          <em>can_change_username</em> business bot right. Returns <em>True</em> on 
